id: pm-llbnua
title: Sentry-injected release artifacts exceed the CI package budget because pre- and post-injection packlists share one ceiling
description: "Release run 33882558951 passed the 20,000,000-byte package budget before publication only until Sentry injected debug IDs into the shipped JavaScript. The exact v2026.9.4 artifact then measured 20,140,358 bytes and failed, while a clean pre-injection exact-tag build measures 19,926,990 bytes. Model and gate both artifact phases explicitly so CI constrains the base package, release constrains the actual Sentry-injected package, and immutable exact-tag recovery can publish without moving the tag or weakening source-map observability."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: distribution,packaging,release,sentry
created_at: "2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-04T15:11:14.721Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-04T15:11:14.234Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-04T15:11:14.234Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "CI and release enforce named, reviewable pre-injection and post-injection artifact budgets; the post-injection gate validates the bytes actually published without disabling Sentry debug IDs; negative controls reject an unknown profile and oversize artifacts in either profile; workflow contracts prove the base gate runs before injection and the injected gate runs after it; exact v2026.9.4 recovery passes packaging, npm/npx/bunx and installed-agent acceptance, and GitHub Release verification without moving the immutable tag."
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make package-size assurance represent the exact artifact users install
value: The release must preserve Sentry symbolication and artifact-size discipline without a false mismatch between CI and publication environments.
why_now: Immutable v2026.9.4 is unpublished and release recovery is blocked before npm publication.
parent: pm-e70zh5
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions Release exact-tag recovery for v2026.9.4 after Sentry debug-ID injection
repro_steps: "Build immutable v2026.9.4 and npm pack: 19,926,990 bytes; inject Sentry debug IDs into dist and rerun scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs: hosted run reports 20,140,358 > 20,000,000."
resolution: "Replaced the single unpacked-size ceiling with named base and sentry-injected profiles, enforced the base pack before Sentry debug-ID injection and the exact publishable pack afterward, emitted the active profile and ceiling, rejected malformed or repeated selectors, preserved shared composition/source-map controls, added workflow and negative-control tests, and documented the release contract."
expected_result: "CI constrains the reproducible base package, release constrains the exact Sentry-injected bytes before publication, malformed or oversized artifacts fail closed, and immutable v2026.9.4 recovery can retain Sentry symbolication without moving its tag."
actual_result: "Focused tests, exact 100/100/100/100 repository coverage, tracker-aware static quality, type/docs/security/dependency gates, zero-finding security diff review, and real exact-tag pre/post-injection manual acceptance passed. The base artifact is below 20,000,000 bytes and the Sentry-injected v2026.9.4 artifact is 20,140,358 bytes below its reviewed 20,250,000-byte ceiling with 1,421 files and no source maps."
affected_version: 2026.9.4
component: release-packaging
regression: true
customer_impact: "Validated SDK and CLI changes cannot reach npm, npx, bunx, or GitHub Release."
