comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for Sentry/debug-ID/package artifact/budget/release found closed artifact owner pm-998juj, exact-tag recovery pm-e63v1x, open released-artifact acceptance pm-ygli86, release-health reminder pm-7zs0, observability join pm-23lmm5, and aggregate release reliability pm-e70zh5. None models distinct pre-injection and post-injection packlist budgets, so this is the recurrence child under pm-e70zh5. Production evidence: Release 33882558951 passed changelog, coverage, static, context, compatibility, reliability, and Sentry upload, then failed before publication at 20,140,358 > 20,000,000; clean exact-tag pre-injection pack is 19,926,990 bytes."
  "2026-09-04T14:43:48.497Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: focused artifact and workflow contracts fail in five expected places. The gate does not emit a named base profile, ignores the Sentry-injected profile and unknown-profile negative control, no longer applies the 100-byte test ceiling after the budget schema change, and release.yml lacks the injected gate and required base-before-injection ordering. Existing unrelated workflow assertions remain green."
  "2026-09-04T14:46:11.671Z","harness:codex","Manual exact-tag acceptance: immutable v2026.9.4 measured 19,926,990 bytes/1,421 files under the base 20,000,000-byte profile. A real sentry-cli debug-ID injection modified the built sources, after which the exact publishable pack measured the hosted failure value 20,140,358 bytes/1,421 files and passed only the separately named 20,250,000-byte sentry-injected profile. Source maps remain forbidden in both profiles."
  "2026-09-04T15:10:50.936Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: focused unit/workflow suite passed 26 tests; full coverage passed at exactly 61,887/61,887 statements, 46,872/46,872 branches, 12,870/12,870 functions, and 59,544/59,544 lines; tracker-aware pnpm quality:static passed in 415.9s over the complete 2,629-item sandbox clone; typecheck, docs links, secret scan, pnpm high-severity audit, git diff check, and the live base pack gate all passed. The committed base gate measures 19,960,509 bytes/1,423 files on current source. Security diff scan scan_pm_cli_sentry_artifact_diff_20260904T150845Z completed with every changed source/config/workflow/test/doc/tracker surface accounted for and zero reportable findings."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T15:10:51.423Z","harness:codex","A release mutation boundary needs its own named policy profile: validate the reproducible base build before observability injection, then validate the exact publishable packlist after injection. Sharing one ceiling across both phases makes CI evidence non-representative; disabling debug IDs would instead weaken production diagnostics. Keep composition rules common and only separate the measured size ceilings."
